SUMMARY:Tampa Police Quarterly Awards Ceremony
LOCATION:Tampa Convention Center 333 S Franklin St Ballroom A Tampa \, FL 
 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:In recognition of the officers\, professional staff\, and comm
 unity members who have exhibited acts of heroism\, bravery\, or kindness o
 ver the past three months\, the Tampa Police Department will host its quar
 terly awards ceremony to honor these heroes and their outstanding efforts.
  The ceremony will be held at 2:00 pm on Thursday\, September 17\, 2026 \,
  in Ballroom A of the Tampa Convention Center and is open to the public. F
 or those unable to attend\, the ceremony will also be livestreamed on face
 book.comTampaPD (http:www.facebook.comTampaPD). Awards being presented at 
 the ceremony will include: The Chiefs Appreciation Award Citizens Apprecia
 tion Award Unit Citation Award Excellent Duty Award Life-Saving Award Awar
 d of Merit Tactical Excellence Award Community Policing Officer of the Mon
 th Employee of the Month Officer of the Month \n\nPermalink: https://www.t
 ampa.gov/node/194991
